icance was determined on the basis of nonoverlapping confidence intervals.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Estimates are poststratified by age and sex and for some states by race/ethnicity to adjust for nonresponses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}